  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently when you have Gestures toggled of with Quest Controllers you will be getting finger movement from Steams Skeletal Input, this is working fine over the Network.\n\nWhen doing Gestures however you finger movement switches over to the Gesture Animations. This works as intended locally, but for remote users your hand will visually be stuck open instead of doing the Gesture animation.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nWhen having Gestures enabled remote users should also still see the Gesture Animations on your hand.",
